# Next.js Gym web

- App Router; Server Components by default.
- `"use client"` only for interactive forms, local table UI state, charts.
- Persona route groups: `(auth)`, `(admin)` now; `(trainer)` / `(client)` when those surfaces start — do not block future groups with Admin-only global assumptions.
- Shared code lives in `components/ui` and `lib/*`; persona-specific UI under `components/admin|trainer|client`.
- Fetch via server components / route handlers + typed `lib/api` — not ad-hoc fetch in JSX.
- Use `loading.tsx` / calm skeletons and error UI with recovery paths.
- Theme: consume CSS variables from `docs/ui-theme.md` — no raw brand hex in features.
- Gate navigation and pages by lane/role from session; never trust client-only role flags.
